Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社制作，仅用于日语交流使用\N请勿私自二次上传及用作商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻译:阿恁&雪音  校对:狗粮山  时轴:懒鬼后裔樰七  后期:冷面珺  压制:zoe  海报:狗粮山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:03.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,至今为止大家的职位都是临时分配的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:07.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,之后终于要决定大家的最终分配去向了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:12.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要和冬月小姐  分开了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.83,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1077.333,759.333)}第3话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.83,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1246.666,839.999)}初次约饭与私密照片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:31.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:31.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:37.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:37.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:43.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:43.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:49.36,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:49.36,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:57.01,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:57.01,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.90,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.90,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.06,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.06,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.32,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.32,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:14.44,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:14.44,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.60,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.60,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.63,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.63,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:28.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:28.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:50.71,Koori-pictur5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(922,416)}岗位分配通知
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明天起就是正式分配部门了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:05.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果和冬月小姐分到不同的部门怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛同学  拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:20.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,求求了  保佑我和冬月小姐分配到同一个部门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:30.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:36.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:38.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我手机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:53.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还是第一次与他人这么亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果分到同一个部门就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:11.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.21,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,本年度新员工已结束研修培训，现已分配好部门，名单详情通知如下。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.30,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,下记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.30,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,狐森
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.81,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:29.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:46.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:51.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一个部门
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:04.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家都在同一个部门
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:06.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是我的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然后隔壁是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:30.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不仅在一个部门  连座位也挨在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们又是邻座呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样的邻座安排实在是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:56.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,又在一起了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:00.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:06.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不过  之前的成员全在一个部门  真是好巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:10.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,与其说是巧合…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:12.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不如说是命中注定？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,命中  注定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,命中注定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐在一个部门也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:34.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,猫的胡须好像可以作护身符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:38.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望…冰室先生能好事常伴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,多亏了这个护身符啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:54.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛大人  感谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:06:00.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在冲绳的时候  受了她很多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:04.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,研修旅行时  在我融化的时候也救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:07.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,总会关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我实在欠她太多人情了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有没有什么方法能偿还这些恩情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:34.74,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,表达谢意的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:34.74,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE292EA&}餐厅款待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看来你很喜欢吃油炸食品呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为我是妖狐的后裔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:53.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐喜欢吃什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜欢的食物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:04.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我什么都喜欢  从小就不挑食
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:07.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不挑食啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.24,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,诶  真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:10.67,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,我有家推荐的油炸店下次一起去吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:09.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,实在太赞了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我要邀请她去哪儿吃好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:20.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,行吧  直接问问看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:29.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:31.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:35.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,法国菜  意大利菜  日料  中餐  韩料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,越南菜  泰国菜  墨西哥菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,印度菜  尼泊尔菜  西班牙菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃哪种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我…都喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:53.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都喜欢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:05.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不按喜欢什么菜而是按餐厅装修来选呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:08.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不对  比起这个  选公司附近的餐厅真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:11.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  又冻上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:18.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊没事  谢谢关心
